# ── VTI reproduction inputs — keep these small files tracked (see readme.md) ──
# `data/` is ignored above; re-include the two small inputs a fresh clone needs
# to run the VTI experiments without upstream fetches or manifest regeneration.
# Parent dirs must be re-included first (git won't descend into an excluded dir).
